id=gpu_dvfs_x6886
name=X6886 GPU DVFS governor
version=v1.3.0
versionCode=4
author=lemonrsh
description=GPU floor/ceiling control for MT6789/GED. Volume keys at install choose SAFER (whole-system top OPP on load, lowest OPP screen-off) or MAX (pinned top OPP). Single 50 C thermal limit; works where /proc/gpufreqv2 is unreadable. Reversible by command or reboot.
